"/events/395700"} "46 from 31 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} [:a {:href "/athletes/125166"} "Hoàng Xuân Vinh"] ", a 41-year old colonel in the Vietnamese Army, won his country’s first Olympic gold medal after a thrilling competition. After 14 shots in the final he had a seemingly comfortable lead, 2.3 points ahead of his closest rival, Brazilian home favorite " [:a {:href "/athletes/132904"} "Felipe Wu"] ". But Hoàng lost his concentration, shooting four 9-pointers in his final five shots, and before the final shot was overtaken by Wu. However, the Vietnamese ended the competition with a perfect 10.7, Wu responded with 10.1, and Hoàng secured the gold by a mere 0.4 points. Defending champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/111749"} "Pang Wei"] " of China, won the bronze medal just three hours after his wife " [:a {:href "/athletes/122169"} "Du Li"] " had secured a silver medal for the family in the women’s 10 m air rifle event."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2091"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/125166"} "Hoàng Xuân Vinh"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/VIE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/VIE.png"}] "VIE"]] [:td {} "581 (4)"] [:td {} "202.5 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "1169"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/132904"} "Felipe Wu"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BRA.png"}] "BRA"]] [:td {} "580 (7)"] [:td {} "202.1 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""